---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="小T｜SDK开发者AI智能客服与知识库系统"
  description="面向 SDK 开发者的 AI 智能客服与知识库系统 Case Study：版本路由、平台冲突澄清、FAQ 治理与评测迭代。"
  current="case"
>
  <div class="cs">
    <!-- ===== Hero ===== -->
    <header class="cs-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="kicker">AI Product Case Study</p>
        <h1 class="cs-title">小T</h1>
        <p class="cs-subtitle">SDK 开发者 AI 智能客服与知识库系统</p>
        <p class="cs-desc">
          将依赖人工回复的 SDK 技术支持流程，转化为基于 SDK 版本与开发平台路由的 AI 问答流程。
        </p>

        <div class="cs-status-row">
          <span class="cs-status-pill">Internal Testing</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Project Metadata -->
        <dl class="cs-meta">
          <div class="cs-meta-item">
            <dt>Role</dt>
            <dd>AI Application / Product Intern</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-meta-item">
            <dt>Context</dt>
            <dd>Developer Technical Support</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-meta-item">
            <dt>Status</dt>
            <dd>Internal Testing</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-meta-item cs-meta-item--wide">
            <dt>Stack</dt>
            <dd>Dify · RAGFlow · Multi-Agent · RAG · Prompt Engineering · Python</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>

        <!-- Interactive Demo entry -->
        <div class="cs-demo">
          <div>
            <span class="cs-demo-label">Interactive Demo</span>
            <p class="cs-demo-status">可在线体验</p>
            <p class="cs-demo-note">前端交互原型，使用预设场景与演示知识库模拟工作流，不接入真实 LLM / Dify。</p>
            <a class="cs-demo-link" href="/work/sdk-ai-support">打开交互原型 →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- ===== Sticky / floating Case Study navigation ===== -->
    <nav class="cs-toc no-print" aria-label="Case Study 目录">
      <div class="cs-toc-inner">
        <a href="/work" class="cs-toc-back">← Work</a>
        <div class="cs-toc-links">
          {[
            ['#problem', '01 Problem'],
            ['#insight', '02 Insight'],
            ['#decision', '03 Decision'],
            ['#flow', '04 Flow'],
            ['#architecture', '05 Architecture'],
            ['#knowledge', '06 Knowledge'],
            ['#evaluation', '07 Evaluation'],
            ['#outcome', '08 Outcome'],
            ['#reflection', '09 Reflection'],
          ].map(([href, label]) => <a href={href}>{label}</a>)}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-progress" id="csProgress"></div>
    </nav>

    <!-- ===== 01 Problem ===== -->
    <section class="cs-section" id="problem">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cs-section-head">
          <span class="cs-section-num">01</span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="cs-section-title">Problem</h2>
            <p class="cs-section-sub">From Manual Support to AI-assisted Support</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cs-body">
          <p>
            SDK 开发者在集成过程中会持续反馈技术问题，传统方式主要依赖技术支持人员人工查询
            SDK 开发文档、FAQ，并组织答案进行回复。
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Traditional process flow -->
        <div class="cs-flow">
          <div class="cs-flow-title">Traditional Flow</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">Developer</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">Submit Question</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">Support Engineer</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">Identify SDK Version</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">Identify Development Platform</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">Search Documentation / FAQ</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">Compose Answer</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step cs-flow-step--end">Reply to Developer</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Problem cards -->
        <div class="cs-cards">
          <div class="cs-card">
            <span class="cs-card-num">01</span>
            <h3>Manual Response</h3>
            <p>大量重复性的 SDK 技术问题依赖人工查询和回复。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-card">
            <span class="cs-card-num">02</span>
            <h3>Knowledge Complexity</h3>
            <p>三个 SDK 大版本 × 多个开发平台 × 数百份 Markdown 文档。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-card">
            <span class="cs-card-num">03</span>
            <h3>Knowledge Boundary</h3>
            <p>不同 SDK 版本和开发平台之间存在差异，错误检索可能导致跨平台回答。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== 02 Product Insight ===== -->
    <section class="cs-section" id="insight">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cs-section-head">
          <span class="cs-section-num">02</span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="cs-section-title">Product Insight</h2>
            <p class="cs-section-sub">Insight before architecture</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="cs-core-statement">回答正确的前提，<br />是先确定“应该回答什么”。</h3>

        <div class="cs-body">
          <p>
            SDK 技术支持并不是简单的“用户提问 → LLM 回答”。核心挑战在于确定：
          </p>
          <ul class="cs-list">
            <li>用户正在使用哪个 SDK 版本</li>
            <li>用户正在使用哪个开发平台</li>
            <li>哪些知识可以被当前 Agent 使用</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Relation visual -->
        <div class="cs-relation">
          <div class="cs-relation-grid">
            <div class="cs-relation-item">SDK Version</div>
            <span class="cs-relation-op">×</span>
            <div class="cs-relation-item">Development Platform</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-relation-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-relation-outcome">Knowledge Boundary</div>
          <div class="cs-relation-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-relation-outcome cs-relation-outcome--accent">Answer Quality</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Highlight -->
        <div class="cs-highlight">
          <span class="cs-highlight-label">Key Insight</span>
          <p>先解决知识边界，再解决回答能力。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== 03 Product Decision ===== -->
    <section class="cs-section" id="decision">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cs-section-head">
          <span class="cs-section-num">03</span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="cs-section-title">Product Decision</h2>
            <p class="cs-section-sub">Why Multi-Agent?</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Before / After -->
        <div class="cs-ba">
          <div class="cs-ba-col cs-ba-col--before">
            <div class="cs-ba-head">
              <span class="cs-ba-badge">Before</span>
              <h3>Single Agent</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="cs-flow cs-flow--mini">
              <div class="cs-flow-step">User</div>
              <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
              <div class="cs-flow-step">Single Agent</div>
              <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
              <div class="cs-flow-step">All SDK Knowledge</div>
              <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
              <div class="cs-flow-step">LLM</div>
            </div>
            <ul class="cs-list">
              <li>Version confusion</li>
              <li>Platform confusion</li>
              <li>Large retrieval scope</li>
              <li>Cross-platform answer risk</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="cs-ba-col cs-ba-col--after">
            <div class="cs-ba-head">
              <span class="cs-ba-badge cs-ba-badge--accent">After</span>
              <h3>Multi-Agent Routing</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="cs-flow cs-flow--mini">
              <div class="cs-flow-step">User</div>
              <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
              <div class="cs-flow-step">SDK Version Router</div>
              <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
              <div class="cs-flow-step">TopOn / Taku / 酷盈</div>
              <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
              <div class="cs-flow-step">Platform Context</div>
              <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
              <div class="cs-flow-step">Platform-specific Knowledge</div>
              <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
              <div class="cs-flow-step">RAG</div>
              <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
              <div class="cs-flow-step cs-flow-step--end">LLM</div>
            </div>
            <ul class="cs-list">
              <li>Version boundary</li>
              <li>Platform context</li>
              <li>Narrower retrieval scope</li>
              <li>Reduced cross-platform answer risk</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Core decision -->
        <div class="cs-core-decision">
          <span class="cs-core-decision-label">Core Decision</span>
          <p>先路由，再检索。</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Diagram placeholder -->
        <div class="cs-placeholder">
          <div class="cs-placeholder-label">Why Multi-Agent Diagram</div>
          <p>Figma asset coming soon</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== 04 Product Flow ===== -->
    <section class="cs-section" id="flow">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cs-section-head">
          <span class="cs-section-num">04</span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="cs-section-title">Product Flow</h2>
            <p class="cs-section-sub">From User Question to AI Answer</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Main flow -->
        <div class="cs-flow">
          <div class="cs-flow-title">User Journey</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">Developer</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">SDK Version</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">Platform Context</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">Agent Routing</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">Knowledge Retrieval</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">LLM</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step cs-flow-step--end">Answer</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Platform branch -->
        <h3 class="cs-h3">Platform known?</h3>
        <div class="cs-branch">
          <div class="cs-branch-col">
            <div class="cs-branch-node cs-branch-node--yes">Yes</div>
            <p>直接进入对应平台知识检索</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-branch-col">
            <div class="cs-branch-node cs-branch-node--no">No</div>
            <p class="cs-branch-list">
              先询问开发平台<br />Android / iOS / Unity / Flutter / Cocos / Harmony
            </p>
            <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
            <p>对应平台知识</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Product flow diagram placeholder -->
        <div class="cs-placeholder">
          <div class="cs-placeholder-label">Product Flow Diagram</div>
          <p>Figma asset coming soon</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Product principle -->
        <div class="cs-principle">
          <span class="cs-principle-label">When Context Is Missing</span>
          <p>先澄清，再检索。不要让模型猜测用户的平台。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== 05 AI Architecture ===== -->
    <section class="cs-section" id="architecture">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cs-section-head">
          <span class="cs-section-num">05</span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="cs-section-title">AI Architecture</h2>
            <p class="cs-section-sub">Multi-Agent + RAG</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cs-body">
          <p>
            企业项目使用 Dify 搭建工作流，并使用 RAGFlow 管理知识库。
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Architecture flow -->
        <div class="cs-flow">
          <div class="cs-flow-step">User</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">Version Router</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">TopOn / Taku / 酷盈 Agents</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">Platform Context</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">Platform-specific Knowledge Base</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">RAGFlow</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">SDK Documentation + FAQ</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">LLM</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step cs-flow-step--end">Answer</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Architecture diagram placeholder -->
        <div class="cs-placeholder cs-placeholder--large">
          <div class="cs-placeholder-label">AI Architecture Diagram</div>
          <p>Figma asset coming soon</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Architecture note -->
        <div class="cs-note">
          <p>通过 SDK 版本分流与平台上下文约束，限制 Agent 的知识检索范围。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== 06 Knowledge Engineering ===== -->
    <section class="cs-section" id="knowledge">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cs-section-head">
          <span class="cs-section-num">06</span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="cs-section-title">Knowledge Engineering</h2>
            <p class="cs-section-sub">Knowledge base governance & document relationship</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ governance -->
        <h3 class="cs-h3">FAQ Governance</h3>
        <div class="cs-faq">
          <div class="cs-faq-stat">
            <span class="cs-faq-number">600+</span>
            <span class="cs-faq-label">Historical FAQ</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-faq-arrow">→</div>
          <div class="cs-faq-mid">
            <p>Cleaning / Deduplication / Normalization</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-faq-arrow">→</div>
          <div class="cs-faq-stat">
            <span class="cs-faq-number cs-faq-number--accent">100+</span>
            <span class="cs-faq-label">Curated FAQ</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="cs-caption">
          参与 600+ 条历史 FAQ 的清洗与治理，整理为 100+ 条可用于知识库的 FAQ。
        </p>

        <!-- Documentation -->
        <h3 class="cs-h3">Documentation</h3>
        <div class="cs-doc">
          <div class="cs-doc-versions">
            <span class="cs-doc-item">TopOn</span>
            <span class="cs-doc-item">Taku</span>
            <span class="cs-doc-item">酷盈</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-doc-op">×</div>
          <div class="cs-doc-platforms">
            <span class="cs-doc-item">Android</span>
            <span class="cs-doc-item">iOS</span>
            <span class="cs-doc-item">Unity</span>
            <span class="cs-doc-item">Flutter</span>
            <span class="cs-doc-item">Cocos</span>
            <span class="cs-doc-item">Harmony</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-doc-arrow">↓</div>
          <p class="cs-doc-result">数百份 Markdown SDK 文档</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Document relationship -->
        <h3 class="cs-h3">Document Relationship</h3>
        <div class="cs-body">
          <p>
            SDK 文档之间存在大量超链接关联，但模型检索过程中无法充分利用这些文档关系。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-relationship">
          <div class="cs-rel-node">Document A</div>
          <div class="cs-rel-line"><span>↕</span></div>
          <div class="cs-rel-node">Document B</div>
          <div class="cs-rel-line"><span>↕</span></div>
          <div class="cs-rel-node">Document C</div>
          <p class="cs-rel-caption">Python-generated document relationship graph</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== 07 AI Evaluation ===== -->
    <section class="cs-section" id="evaluation">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cs-section-head">
          <span class="cs-section-num">07</span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="cs-section-title">AI Evaluation</h2>
            <p class="cs-section-sub">Test → Analyze → Optimize → Regression</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Evaluation loop -->
        <h3 class="cs-h3">Evaluation Loop</h3>
        <div class="cs-flow">
          <div class="cs-flow-step">Historical FAQ</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">Test Case Design</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">AI Answer</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">Result Review</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">Problem Analysis</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step">Prompt / Knowledge Optimization</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="cs-flow-step cs-flow-step--end">Regression Test ↺</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Test case types -->
        <h3 class="cs-h3">Test Case Types</h3>
        <div class="cs-tags">
          <span class="tag">具体问题</span>
          <span class="tag">模糊问题</span>
          <span class="tag">不同 SDK Version</span>
          <span class="tag">不同 Platform</span>
          <span class="tag">跨平台干扰场景</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Evaluation table -->
        <h3 class="cs-h3">Evaluation Samples</h3>
        <div class="cs-table-wrap">
          <table class="cs-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Test Case</th>
                <th>Version</th>
                <th>Platform</th>
                <th>Expected Behavior</th>
                <th>Result</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>具体 SDK 问题</td>
                <td>TopOn</td>
                <td>Android</td>
                <td>Use Android Knowledge</td>
                <td class="cs-ok">✓</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>模糊问题</td>
                <td>TopOn</td>
                <td>Unknown</td>
                <td>Ask Platform</td>
                <td class="cs-ok">✓</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>跨平台场景</td>
                <td>TopOn</td>
                <td>iOS</td>
                <td>Avoid Android Knowledge</td>
                <td class="cs-ok">✓</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="cs-caption">
          以上为展示 Evaluation 方法的示例，不代表正式生产准确率。
        </p>

        <!-- Retrieval experiment -->
        <div class="cs-experiment">
          <div>
            <span class="cs-experiment-label">Retrieval Experiment</span>
            <p class="cs-experiment-value">Top-K&nbsp; 0.4 → 0.8</p>
            <p class="cs-experiment-note">
              内部测试过程中曾调整检索参数，将 Top-K 从 0.4 调整至 0.8 后，内部测试中的错误回答有所减少。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== 08 Outcome ===== -->
    <section class="cs-section" id="outcome">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cs-section-head">
          <span class="cs-section-num">08</span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="cs-section-title">Outcome</h2>
            <p class="cs-section-sub">Current state & validated results</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="cs-core-statement cs-core-statement--accent">Internal Testing</h3>

        <div class="cs-body">
          <p>
            完成 AI 客服内部测试，验证：
          </p>
          <ul class="cs-list">
            <li>SDK 版本分流</li>
            <li>平台上下文识别</li>
            <li>知识库检索</li>
            <li>AI 问答流程</li>
          </ul>
          <p>并通过测试用例持续进行 Prompt 与知识库迭代。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="cs-cards">
          <div class="cs-card">
            <span class="cs-card-num">01</span>
            <h3>Routing Validated</h3>
            <p>SDK Version / Platform routing validated</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-card">
            <span class="cs-card-num">02</span>
            <h3>Knowledge Retrieval Validated</h3>
            <p>Documentation + FAQ retrieval workflow validated</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-card">
            <span class="cs-card-num">03</span>
            <h3>Evaluation Loop Established</h3>
            <p>Test → Optimize → Regression workflow established</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cs-note">
          <p>
            项目处于 Internal Testing 阶段，未对外正式上线，不包含商业指标与用户数据。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== 09 Reflection ===== -->
    <section class="cs-section" id="reflection">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cs-section-head">
          <span class="cs-section-num">09</span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="cs-section-title">Reflection</h2>
            <p class="cs-section-sub">What I Learned</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cs-cards cs-cards--four">
          <div class="cs-card">
            <span class="cs-card-num">01</span>
            <h3>Knowledge Boundary</h3>
            <p>AI 产品的核心不只是接入 LLM，而是设计正确的知识边界。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-card">
            <span class="cs-card-num">02</span>
            <h3>Clarification</h3>
            <p>当用户信息不足时，澄清问题比让模型猜测更可靠。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-card">
            <span class="cs-card-num">03</span>
            <h3>Evaluation</h3>
